window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Sixteen-year-old Mochizuki Touya continues his noble quest to delve into the Babylon Ruins, but a deadly tabletop session could easily spell turmoil for the boy and his party.</b></p> <p>Meanwhile, Leen the fairy makes some considerations with far-reaching implications...</p> <p>Prepare your best dice rolls for a hair-raising tale of swords, sorcery, and forbidden knowledge!</p> <p><i>Narrated in duet style.</i></p>"; 
